gcc 2.7.2.3 as a cross compiler for AMIX, built by a modern host gcc:
- cccp.c, gcc.c: strerror instead of sys_errlist/sys_nerr
- gcc2_compiled% becomes gcc2_compiled and .lcomm loses its alignment
  operand, for GNU as / binutils 2.8.1
- config/m68k/m68k.md ashrdi_const: a signed 64-bit >> 16 sign-extended the
  wrong half of the high word (no swap before ext.l), so the high long was 0
  or -1; the unsigned twin has the swap (kdedon/ashnazag#282, broke dropbear
  signatures)

